\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Per-category hard-token faithfulness on the held-out $1{,}000$-prompt evaluation. Cells are token-pooled hit rates within category (sum of recovered tokens over sum of requested tokens, across all prompts). REP tokens (replication proteins) appear in $<1\%$ of evaluation prompts and are omitted for space. The overall per-prompt mean faithfulness $\bar  F$ is reported separately in the surrounding text and uses a different aggregation (mean over prompts of $F_i$); the two numerators differ because a small number of prompts contribute many tokens each.}}{10}{table.caption.9}\protected@file@percent }
